  "description": "Design on a canvas that Claude can read and write to — built on web standards.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `code-to-design` (Generate a Paper design from the project's codebase — using its tokens, styles, and components as context), `design-to-code` (Turn a Paper design into production code using the project's existing conventions)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `paper`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install paper-desktop@claude-community` from `paper-design/agent-plugins` (`plugins/paper-desktop`).",
